OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'fiddly and frustrating' work
OL,4,Aremoving 10,000 coins from Giant's
OL,5,ACauseway columns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe equivalent of 10,000 coins have
OL,8,Fbeen painstakingly removed from the
OL,9,FGiant's Causeway following years of
OL,10,Fvisitors jamming them between the
OL,11,Fcolumns.
OL,13,FConservationists working to protect
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland's iconic World
OL,15,FHeritage Site have removed more than
OL,16,F20kg (44.1 lb) of unwanted coins from
OL,17,Fbetween its basalt pillars.
OL,19,FWork to remove the coins got under way
OL,20,Fin May last year following concerns the
OL,21,Fcoins were damaging the causeway's
OL,22,Frocks.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
