OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'fiddly and frustrating' work
OL,4,Aremoving 10,000 coins from Giant's
OL,5,ACauseway columns
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It is a relief, the coins were doing a
OL,8,Fsignificant amount of damage ," Dr
OL,9,FCliff Henry, nature engagement officer
OL,10,Fwith the National Trust said.
